    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +1 and ATK & DEF 200%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches an additional Super Attack\n- Super Class allies' Ki +5 and DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Extreme Class enemies' ATK & DEF 70%{passiveImg:down_y}\n*When there is another ally whose name includes \"Great Saiyaman\"\nattacking in the same turn, or when there are 3 \"Special Pose\"\nCategory allies attacking in the same turn*\n- ATK 150%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Damage reduction rate 60%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack 80%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*As the 1st or 2nd attacker in a turn*\n- Attacks are effective against all Types\n- ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g} and chance of performing a critical hit 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\nfor allies whose names include \"Great Saiyaman\"\n*As the 3rd attacker in a turn*\n- Performs a critical hit\n- Survives K.O. attacks (up to once within a turn)\n- Recovers 12% HP at the end of turn\n*When attacking*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking a Super Class enemy*\n- All allies' ATK 30%{passiveImg:up_g} for 2 turns (self excluded)\n*When attacking an Extreme Class enemy*\n- ATK 100%{passiveImg:up_g}",
